  "description": "isPrivateHostname on hostnames as the URL parser leaves them (IPv6 in brackets) and as typed directly. The /etc/hosts loopback names localhost.localdomain, localhost4, localhost4.localdomain4, localhost6, localhost6.localdomain6, ip6-localhost and ip6-loopback count as this machine. One trailing dot is dropped first, and IPv6 is read in the URL parser's spelling, so every spelling of one address gives the same answer.",
